{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50015","headline":"句 · 金立之","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟破树头惊宿鸟，露凝苔上暗流萤。\n山人见月宁思寝，更掬寒泉满手霜。\n绀殿雨晴松色冷，禅林风起竹声余。\n风过古殿香烟散，月到前林竹露清。\n更有闲宵清净境，曲江澄月对心虚。\n寒露已催鸿北去，火云渐散月西流。\n园梅坼甲迎春笑，庭草抽心待节芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"金立之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50015.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50015","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}